\v 5 “\add ≈I've already made my decision\add*,” the¦356776 king¦356776 replied¦356775. “If¦356783 you¦356785 all can't¦356784 tell¦356777 me¦356785 the¦356786 dream¦356786 and¦356787 \add then give\add* its¦356787 interpretation¦356787, you'll¦356789 all be¦356789 torn limb from limb and¦356790 your¦356790 houses¦356790 made into a¦356791 rubbish heap.
