\v 7 “Let¦356816 the¦356814 king¦356814 tell¦356816 his¦356817 servants¦356817 the¦356815 dream¦356815,” they \add ≈insisted\add*, “and¦356818 we'll¦356819 give the¦356818 interpretation¦356818.”
