\v 19 Then¦357047 the¦357053 mystery¦357053 was¦357054 revealed¦357054 to¦357048 Daniyel¦357048 in¦357049 a vision¦357049 during the¦357052 night¦357052. Aftewrwards, Daniyel¦357056 blessed¦357057 the god¦357058 of the¦357059 heavens¦357059
