\p
\v 24 So¦357152 Daniyel¦357139 went¦357140 to¦357141 Areyok¦357143, the man that¦357138 the¦357146 king¦357146 had¦357145 appointed¦357145 to¦357147 execute Bavel's¦357149 \add !(Babylon¦357149)\add* wise men, and told¦357153 him¦357155, “Don't¦357158 hurt the wise men in Bavel¦357157. Take¦357161 me¦357161 in to the¦357163 king¦357163 and¦357164 I'll¦357166 tell \add *him\add* the \add dream and\add* \add &its\add* interpretation¦357164.”
