\v 25 Areyok¦357170 quickly¦357171 took¦357172 Daniyel¦357173 in¦357172 to¦357173 the¦357175 king¦357175 and¦357176 told¦357177 him¦357179, “I've¦357182 found¦357182 a¦357183 man¦357183 among the exiles¦357187 from Yehudah¦357189 \add !(Judah¦357189)\add* who¦357190 will reveal the¦357191 interpretation¦357191 \add of your dream\add*.”
