\v 26 ⇔“Are¦357202 you¦357202 able¦357204 to¦357205 tell¦357197 me¦357205 the¦357206 dream¦357206 that¦357207 I¦357209 saw¦357209, and¦357210 its¦357210 interpretation¦357210?” the¦357196 king¦357196 \add ≈asked\add* Daniyel¦357198 (also called¦357200 Belteshatsar¦357201 \add !(Belteshazzar¦357201)\add*).
