\v 27 ⇔“No wise¦357223 men¦357223, enchanters¦357224, magicians¦357225, or astrologers¦357226 are¦357227 able¦357227 to¦357228 do what the king has demanded,” replied¦357212 Daniyel¦357213.
\v 28 “However¦357231, there¦357232 is¦357233 a¦357233 god¦357233 in¦357234 the¦357234 heavens¦357234 who¦357235 reveals¦357235 mysteries¦357236, and¦357237 he's¦357237 the¦357238 one who's shown you, King¦357238 Nevukadnetsar¦357239 \add !(Nebuchadnezzar¦357239)\add*, what¦357240 will¦357242 happen in¦357243 the¦357244 days¦357244 \add ≈to come\add*. This¦357251 was your¦357245 dream¦357245 and¦357246 the visions¦357246 in your¦357247 mind¦357247 while you were in your¦357250 bed¦357250:
\v 29 Oh¦357258 king¦357258, \add ≈as you lay there\add* your¦357259 thoughts¦357259 turned to what¦357264 would¦357266 happen \add ≈in the future\add*, and¦357269 the¦357270 one who reveals¦357269 mysteries¦357270 showed you¦357271 what¦357272 is¦357275 going to happen.
\v 30 As for me¦357283, this¦357290 mystery¦357289 was¦357291 revealed¦357291 to¦357292 me¦357292, not because I'm wiser than¦357284 \add ≈anyone else\add*, but¦357293 so that¦357297 the¦357298 interpretation¦357298 could be revealed to¦357299 the¦357299 king¦357299, and¦357301 so that you¦357303 can \add ≈understand¦357303 what you saw¦357300 in\add* your¦357302 \add ≈mind¦357302\add*.
\p
\v 31 “What you¦357305 were looking¦357309 at, \add ≈your¦357308 majesty¦357308\add*, was¦357310 an¦357312 incredible, huge statue¦357315. It was¦357317 heavy and¦357318 \add ≈shone brightly\add* as it stood¦357320 \add there\add* \add ≈in¦357321 front¦357321 of¦357321\add* you¦357321—a terrifying¦357323 sight.
\v 32 The¦357326 statue's head¦357327 was¦357328 made of¦357328 pure gold¦357330, its¦357332 chest¦357332 and¦357333 arms¦357333 were¦357334 silver¦357335, its¦357336 belly¦357336 and¦357337 thighs¦357337 were¦357338 bronze¦357339,
\v 33 its¦357341 legs¦357341 were¦357342 made of¦357342 iron¦357343, and its¦357344 feet¦357344 were¦357347 \add ≈a combination\add* of¦357347 iron¦357348 and¦357349 clay¦357352.
