\v 10 This is the \add #vision¦358605\add* that was in my¦358606 mind¦358606 as a lay in bed¦358609: I¦358611 was¦358611 looking and¦358612 was surprised to see¦358610 \add ≈a¦358613 very tall\add* tree¦358613 growing in¦358614 the¦358614 middle¦358614 of \add ≈a field\add*.
