\v 16 Let¦358726 his \add ≈mind\add*\f + \fr 4:16 \ft It seems now that the tree represented a man.\f* be¦358726 changed¦358726 from a man¦358724 to an¦358728 animal¦358728 as seven¦358731 periods¦358732 pass¦358733 over¦358734 him.
