\p
\v 18 I¦358773, King¦358774 Nevukadnetsar¦358775 \add !(Nebuchadnezzar¦358775)\add*, had this¦358770 dream¦358771. Now you¦358776, Belteshatsar¦358778 \add !(Belteshazzar¦358778)\add*, tell me the interpretation, because¦358784 none of¦358787 the¦358789 wise¦358789 men¦358789 in my¦358790 kingdom¦358790 can tell me the¦358794 interpretation¦358794. But¦358796 you¦358796 can, because the spirit¦358800 of¦358800 the holy¦358803 gods¦358802 is in you¦358804.”
