\v 22 That was¦358873 you¦358873, \add ≈your¦358877 majesty¦358877\add*. You've¦358879 grown¦358879 and¦358880 become strong¦358880—your¦358881 greatness¦358881 has¦358882 grown¦358882 and¦358883 reaches¦358883 to¦358884 \add #heaven¦358884\add*, and¦358885 your¦358885 dominion¦358885 to¦358886 the¦358886 \add #ends¦358886\add* of¦358886 the¦358887 earth¦358887.
