\v 16 But¦359598 I've¦359599 heard¦359599 about¦359600 you¦359600—that¦359602 you're¦359604 able¦359604 to¦359608 give interpretations¦359608 and¦359609 solve problems. Now¦359611, if¦359612 you're¦359613 able¦359613 to¦359616 read¦359616 \add &that\add* writing¦359615 and¦359617 \add ≈tell me¦359618 what it means\add*, you'll¦359620 be¦359620 clothed¦359620 with \add ≈kingly¦359619 robes\add* and¦359621 have a chain¦359621 of¦359624 gold¦359626 \add placed\add* around your¦359629 neck¦359629, and¦359630 you'll¦359632 be \add made\add* the third¦359630\add -highest\add* ruler¦359632 in¦359631 the¦359631 kingdom¦359631.”
