\p
\v 18 “As for you¦359654, \add ≈your¦359656 majesty¦359656\add*, the¦359657 highest¦359658 god¦359657 gave¦359664 the kingship, power, honour¦359662, and¦359663 majesty¦359663, to¦359665 your¦359666 father¦359666 Nevukadnetsar¦359665 \add !(Nebuchadnezzar¦359665)\add*.
