\p
\v 22 “Yet you¦359770, Belshatsar¦359773 \add !(Belshazzar¦359773)\add*, his¦359772 son¦359772, haven't humbled¦359775 \add ≈yourself despite already knowing¦359784 all¦359781 that¦359783\add*.
