\s2 Daniyel's saved from the lions
\rem /s1 Daniel Saved from the Lions
\p
\v 19 Then¦360390 the¦360391 king¦360391 got up at¦360392 dawn¦360392, and¦360395 \add ≈hurried¦360395 out\add* to¦360396 the¦360399 lions'¦360399 den¦360396.
\v 20 As¦360403 he¦360403 \add ≈approached¦360403\add* the¦360404 den¦360404, he¦360408 called¦360408 out¦360408 in a worried voice¦360406, “Daniyel¦360412, Daniyel¦360413, servant¦360414 of¦360414 the¦360416 living¦360416 god¦360417. Has your¦360417 god, who¦360418 you¦360419 serve \add ≈continually¦360424\add*, been¦360425 able¦360425 to¦360426 save¦360426 you¦360426 from¦360427 the¦360429 lions¦360429?”
